00:06:03,529 --> 00:06:09,529
The Rider is a drama, western film directed by Chloé Zhao.

2
00:12:07,058 --> 00:12:13,058
Once a rising star of the rodeo circuit, and a gifted horse trainer, young cowboy Brady is
warned that his riding days are over after a horse crushed his skull at a rodeo.

3
00:18:10,588 --> 00:18:16,588
In an attempt to regain control of his own fate, Brady undertakes a search for a new
identity and what it means to be a man in the heartland of the United States.

